Swordman Miles 5.0m compatibility DLL

The complete mss32.dll is derived from the verified game-local Miles 5.0m DLL.
Its original copyright information and license remain applicable.
Original SHA-256: 6a128953250b3d142245a9ca6facabf308666703c1f9c8c5b6ac95acce95403d
Modified SHA-256: f2d040218d7e63f83c799b005f688c1b4b150994442996b4c4929a46a1f15743

One opcode at file offset 0x13bd is changed from TEST EAX,EAX to XOR EAX,EAX.
This zeros the audio timer's local suspend preference snapshot, so its existing
branches skip both SuspendThread and ResumeThread. All 315 original exports,
the PE import table, resources and relocations are retained.

This file is a complete DLL. It does not load mss32_autorun_original.dll.
The former LGPL proxy and its source remain in compat/swordman-miles for
historical reproduction; the adaptation package no longer installs that proxy.
